        "created_at": "2014-09-01T17:25:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I am soon going to paint my mini’s.  I was thinking a 3d map would be fun to play with them.  So I have been looking for 3d hex tile games and all I could find is heroscape.   Anyone have any suggestions on any others?  Also has anyone tried somethino like this already?</p>",
